window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Anastasia:</b></p> <p>The plan was to collect everything I could on the Bonetti Brothers and take them down. As an Assistant District Attorney, I want to keep the community safe from this mafia family. More than that, I was attempting to make a name for myself. Little did I know the way things would fall apart. I didn’t see him coming. The man with the nickname that matches him to a ’T’.</p> <p><b>Psycho:</b></p> <p><i>Pretty little lamb you should not have come into the wolf’s den.</i></p> <p>She wanted to know more about the Bonetti Brothers. Her wish is my command. The pretty little counselor will learn firsthand that you do not fuck with us.</p> <p><i>One, two, Psycho is coming for you.<br> Three, four, your blood will coat my floor.<br> Five, six, you’ll beg to live.<br> Seven, eight, it’s too late.<br> Nine, ten, scream for me again.</i></p> <p>Anastasia Crowne, the young ADA, wants to destroy everything we’ve built. She’s an eager little lamb that walked into the wolf’s den. This wolf is hungry. Famished. She’ll be mine to torture for weeks, if not months. When I get bored, it’ll be over for her.</p>"; 
